..!interpreter english translate noabbrev
..*****************************************************************************
.. FOP-Name       : PARTNERID.KEDI.FA
.. Autor          : mh/ok
.. Verantwortlich : mh
.. Kontrolle      : carue
.. Funktion       : Uebernimmt die Kundendaten aus der EDI-Nachricht
.. Functionality  : Fetches customer data from edi message
..*****************************************************************************
.set trans -
..
.colour  -background -1 -1 -1  kergebnis   0
.colour  -background -1 -1 -1  kidkundeab  0
..
.formula M|kidkundeab = M|kedi^idkundeab
.formula M|kidabkunde = M|kedi^idabkunde
.formula M|kwerk      = M|kedi^werk
.formula M|kablstelle = M|kedi^ablstelle
.formula M|kergebnis = ""
..
.copy M|kedinachr = M|kedi^edinachr
.input "dfue/PARTNERID.KEDINACHR.FA"
..
..*****************************************************************************
!END
.continue
